<title>INDONESIA: Duta Pertiwi 1996 net up to 96.11 bln rp.</title>
<headline>Duta Pertiwi 1996 net up to 96.11 bln rp.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 1996</p>
<p>(in billion rupiah unless earnings per share)</p>
<p>Net income			  96.11 vs  92.15</p>
<p>Earnings per share (rupiah)  312.72 vs 297.81  </p>
<p>    Revenues			   337.24 vs 474.88</p>
<p>    Gross profit		     143.33 vs 224.72</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  53.85 vs 145.27</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   143.07 vs 144.23</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		212.87 vs 146.16</p>
<p>NOTE: The consolidated results were audited. PT Duta Pertiwi, a member of the Sinar Mas Group, is a property developer.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
